+# tasklite
+
+Task tracker: CLI + JSON HTTP API over one JSON file. Python 3.8+, stdlib only.
+
+## Commands
+- Test: `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -t .` (offline, fast)
+- CLI: `python3 -m tasklite add|list|done|stats`
+- API: `python3 -m tasklite.api` (127.0.0.1:8080)
+
+## Guardrails
+- No third-party dependencies.
+- `tasks.json` is user data (gitignored); never commit it. Tests use `Store(path)` with a temp file.
+
+## Layout
+- `tasklite/` CLI, API and storage (details in `tasklite/CLAUDE.md`)
+- `tests/` unittest suites for store, cli and api
+
+Overview: [README.md](README.md). Component map: `.ai-ready/components.json`.
